<https://fair-systemdynamics.github.io/fair-hunter-prey-simulation/semantic/#review/lookup-endpoint> a sd:ReviewIssue ;
    rdfs:label "Lookup comment and table disagree" ;
    dcterms:description "The predator-birth comment describes a multiplier of 1.5 at density 2 or above. The external table ends at (2, 1). This draft preserves the table and flags the discrepancy; it does not silently reconcile them." ;
